<header class="page-intro container reveal">
  <p class="eyebrow">Miscellaneous</p>
  <h1>The things I follow, collect, and remember.</h1>
  <p>Outside research, I spend my time on sports, K-pop, and travel: following the NBA and Formula 1, listening to aespa, and keeping a record of the places I visit.</p>
</header>

<section class="interests container">
  <article class="interest reveal">
    <figure class="interest__media">
      <img src="/assets/images/lec.jpg" alt="Formula 1 cars on the grid at Monza beneath a Charles Leclerc banner" width="1915" height="1077">
      <figcaption>Formula 1 at Monza</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="interest__copy">
      <p class="interest__number">01</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">Sports</p>
      <h2>NBA nights and Formula 1 weekends.</h2>
      <p>I follow the Oklahoma City Thunder in NBA and Ferrari in Formula 1. I'm planning trips to see the Thunder and the Las Vegas Grand Prix in person; once those plans become real, I will update this section.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="interest interest--concert reveal">
    <div class="interest__copy">
      <p class="interest__number">02</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">K-pop</p>
      <h2>aespa, live in Los Angeles.</h2>
      <p>I like aespa and their music. I saw them live in Los Angeles on October 3, 2026.</p>
    </div>
    <details class="concert-album">
      <summary class="concert-album__summary">
        <img src="/assets/images/concert/aespa-crowd.jpg" alt="" width="1179" height="766" loading="lazy" decoding="async" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="concert-album__label">
          <small>Concert album</small>
          <strong class="concert-album__open-label">View 4 photos</strong>
          <strong class="concert-album__close-label">Close album</strong>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <figure class="concert-gallery">
        <div class="concert-gallery__grid">
          <img class="concert-gallery__crowd" src="/assets/images/concert/aespa-crowd.jpg" alt="aespa posing on stage with the audience at their Los Angeles concert" width="1179" height="766" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <img class="concert-gallery__close-up" src="/assets/images/concert/aespa-close-up.jpg" alt="Concert screen showing an aespa member singing into a microphone" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <img class="concert-gallery__stage" src="/assets/images/concert/aespa-stage.jpg" alt="aespa performing in front of colorful planet visuals" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <img class="concert-gallery__arena" src="/assets/images/concert/aespa-arena.jpg" alt="Arena-wide view of an aespa member on the concert screens" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
        </div>
        <figcaption>aespa, Los Angeles, October 3</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </details>
  </article>

  <article class="interest interest--travel reveal">
    <div class="interest__copy">
      <p class="interest__number">03</p>
      <p class="eyebrow">Travel</p>
      <h2>A map of places and memories.</h2>
      <p>Each marker opens an album from a place I have visited.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="travel-map">
      <div class="travel-map__surface" id="travel-map" data-travel-map aria-label="Interactive map of places I have visited">
        <img class="travel-map__fallback" src="/assets/images/travel/world-map.svg" alt="" width="2048" height="1039" loading="lazy" aria-hidden="true">
        <p class="travel-map__loading">Loading interactive map</p>
      </div>

      <dialog class="travel-album" id="yosemite-album" aria-labelledby="yosemite-album-title">
        <div class="travel-album__inner">
          <header class="travel-album__header">
            <div>
              <p class="travel-album__meta">California / October 2026</p>
              <h3 id="yosemite-album-title">Yosemite National Park</h3>
            </div>
            <button class="travel-album__close" type="button" data-travel-close>Close</button>
          </header>
          <p class="travel-album__intro">Granite walls, waterfalls, and a clear October sky.</p>
          <div class="travel-album__gallery">
            <img class="travel-album__overlook" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-overlook.jpg" alt="Panoramic view across Yosemite Valley from a high overlook beneath a blue sky" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="travel-album__waterfall" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-waterfall.jpg" alt="Waterfall descending a granite cliff among evergreen trees in Yosemite" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="travel-album__trail" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-waterfall-trail.jpg" alt="Steep waterfall trail beneath dramatic clouds in Yosemite" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="travel-album__lake" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-lake.jpg" alt="Granite peaks and pine trees reflected in still water in Yosemite" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="travel-album__el-capitan" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-el-capitan.jpg" alt="El Capitan rising above the trees in Yosemite Valley" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <img class="travel-album__dinner" src="/assets/images/travel/yosemite-dinner.jpg" alt="Barbecue dinner during the Yosemite trip" width="1800" height="1350" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          </div>
        </div>
      </dialog>

      <dialog class="travel-album" id="dali-album" aria-labelledby="dali-album-title">
        <div class="travel-album__inner">
          <header class="travel-album__header">
            <div><p class="travel-album__meta">Yunnan, China / April 2023</p><h3 id="dali-album-title">Dali</h3></div>
            <button class="travel-album__close" type="button" data-travel-close>Close</button>
          </header>
          <p class="travel-album__intro">Spring by the lake: mountain silhouettes, boats along the shore, flowering streets, and quiet courtyard details.</p>
