          <header class="travel-album__header">
            <div><p class="travel-album__meta">Shaanxi, China / November 2023</p><h3 id="xian-album-title">Xi'an</h3></div>
            <button class="travel-album__close" type="button" data-travel-close>Close</button>
          </header>
          <p class="travel-album__intro">The Bell Tower by day and night, pagoda silhouettes, illuminated rooflines, and a visit to the Terracotta Army.</p>
